+# BP-071 — Filesystem and PACK parity
+
+- Binds 64-byte PACK entries, sequential pak probing, descending pak priority and case-sensitive archive lookup.
+- Preserves shareware loose-subdirectory restrictions, `-proghack`, persistent PACK handles and NUL-terminated load modes.
+- Routes Quake text file I/O through `quake_latin1_cstring_v1`.
+- Adds 24 MiniLang fixtures, a C oracle and a static source contract.
